Q) Sample Input :Na1ra2ya3n4q
Expected Output:Na4ra3ya2n1q

Solution1:

s="Na1ra2ya3n4q"
r=list(s)
o=""
z=[]
for i in s:
    if i.isdigit():
        z.append(i)
z.reverse()
f = 0
for j in range(len(r)):
    if r[j].isdigit():
        for l in range(f,len(z)):
            r[j]=z[l]
            o=o+r[j]
            break;
        f=f+1
    else:
        o=o+r[j]
print(o)
